   "title": "Part (i)",
   "text": "**Review Q7 (i) 7 log x − 3 log y²**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&7\\log x-3\\log y^{2}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log x^{7}-\\log (y^{2})^{3}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{[coefficients $\\to$ powers]}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log x^{7}-\\log y^{6}\\quad \\text{[(y\\^{}2)\\^{}3 = y\\^{}6]}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log (\\frac{x^{7}}{y^{6}})\\quad \\text{[minus $\\to$ divide]}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Part (ii)",
   "text": "**Review Q7 (ii) 3 log 4 − log 32**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&3\\log 4-\\log 32\\\\[5pt]&=\\log 4^{3}-\\log 32\\\\[5pt]&=\\log 64-\\log 32\\\\[5pt]&=\\log (\\frac{64}{32})\\\\[5pt]&=\\log 2\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 1
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Part (iii)",
   "text": "**Review Q7 (iii) (1/3)(log₅ 8 + log₅ 27) − log₅ 3**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&(\\frac{1}{3})(\\log_{5} 8+\\log_{5} 27)-\\log_{5} 3\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{3})\\log_{5} (8\\times 27)-\\log_{5} 3\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{[product law inside the bracket]}\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{3})\\log_{5} 216-\\log_{5} 3\\\\[5pt]&=\\log_{5} 216^{\\frac{1}{3}}-\\log_{5} 3\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{[coefficient $\\to$ power]}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log_{5} 6-\\log_{5} 3\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{[∛216 = 6, because 6\\^{}3 = 216]}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log_{5} (\\frac{6}{3})\\quad \\text{[quotient law]}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log_{5} 2\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
